    "Mega14 static FMUL24 includes16 on its beta0 execution path; identity removes those16 dynamic alpha multiplies. Mega14 already skips C0 loads when beta0, so matched beta0 traffic is not reduced by removing its unreachable C0 branch.",
    "Mega14 static STG.E.64 count16 includes8 in each beta branch; Mega15 count8 is one path. Both execute8 float2 stores per lane on the matched beta0 path. Static stores/loads are not evidence of halved dynamic traffic.",
    "Both retain four LDG.E.128.CONSTANT A loads and four LDG.E.64.CONSTANT B loads per K16,7 HMMA,7 A LDSM.x4 and7 B transposed LDSM.x2,24 packed RN converters,7 STS.128 and7 STS.64. No cache modifier change is observed from14 to15.",
